window.products.push({"id":735015,"name":"MOMOKO Firm Contoured Memory Foam Pillow ​- Orthopedic Pillows for Neck Pain - Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain - Contoured Pillow for Neck Support -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fqtoA4BfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🌙[Warm Tips] ：The cervical memory foam pillow provides support and therapeutic relief of neck pain, shoulder pain, headaches and snoring. Its quality material helps keep you cool and comfortable throughout the night waking up rejuvenated.Please kindly note that our orthopedic neck pillow can effectively prevent cervical vertebra problems, improve your sleep quality, promote a healthy life, but CAN NOT be used for diagnosis or treatment of any disease (e.g. cervical spondylosis.). 🌙【Ergonomic Pillow】： MOMOKO bed pillow is designed with different function areas in defferent height, which is suitable for all kinds of sleeping postures, such as side back and stomach sleeping. And the design can aslo help you to have a correct positon, which makes you breath more smoothly and less snoring to have a cooling sleep. 🌙【Memory Foam Neck Pillow】：Contoured Memory Foam is made of premium slow-rebound memory foam which can evenly absorb the impact force and disperse the pressure, creating balance, comfort, and offer maximum support for sleeping. The material of the cervical support pillow is strong at retaining shape after regular use. 🌙【High Quality Materials】：Breathable memory foam provides better air circulation to keep you cool and dry. Our hypoallergenic pillow it remains consistent firmness and comfortable; All materials are chemical free for good health. The outer cover can be easily removed with a zipper, and it can be hand-washed or machine-washed, so you can always keep it clean and fresh. 🎁【Best Gift】：This neck support pillow is very suitable for elders, office workers, teachers, and those who suffer from sleep disorders. Continuous use of the pillow could improve the sleep quality and health condition. It is an ideal housewarming gift, birthday gift and holiday gift for parents, friends and relatives, expressing your care to your loved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fqtoA4BfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOMOKO","source_asin":"B09JLHPMZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JLHPMZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JLHPMZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
