window.products.push({"id":735155,"name":"100Pcs Christmas Tree Ball Ornaments Set, Red and Gold Assorted Shatterproof Christmas Balls Decorations, Decorative Hanging Baubles for Holiday Weedi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NK9SCpV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100Pcs Valuable Christmas Ornaments: Our Christmas tree ball decorations including 3-size Christmas balls, which are 1.18 inch/3 cm, 1.57 inch/4 cm and 2.36 inch/6 cm. These are the most widely used sizes for decoration of Christmas tree. Among them, there are 32pcs 1.18 inch balls, 32pcs 2.36 inch balls and 36pcs 1.57 inch balls in one pack. Perfect fit for any normal size tree. Enough quantity and reasonable size will surprise you when you decorate your tree or other. Shatterproof and Lightweight: Compared with traditional glass products, our small Christmas ball ornaments are made of durable, high quality and eco-friendly plastic, which is non-toxic and odorless. Christmas ornaments set combine the beauty and luster of real glass with the unbreakable practicality of plastic, they are not easily damaged and light weight. You don't have to worry about the balls hurting your child's hands and weigh down the Christmas tree branches. Classic Colors and Unique Design: Our Christmas tree baubles are available in 9 different styles, such as matte, glaze, glittery, mirrored and various pattern carving. We also have concave and convex patterns. Different surface treatment and shapes make your Christmas tree distinctive and gorgeous. What's more, The combination of red and gold colors will be a good choice for your Christmas decorations. Easy to Use: Our Christmas balls are light weight, each spherical ornament is equipped with a rope hanger and strings, which makes them easy to hang or take off. Using thread string or ribbon through the top caps and hang them on the window or the wall. It will be very eye-catching. You can decorate various holiday products such as Christmas trees, wreaths and garlands in a short time! Perfect for Various Occasions: These shatterproof Christmas tree decorations are suitable for various occasions, like shopping malls, weddings, homes, window displays, festive decoration, candy packaging and more. When you decorate with this red ball ornaments set, it will bring you a festive Christmas. Besides, this ball ornaments set is also an excellent choice for your family, classmates or friends as a gift. They will like it very much when they receive such a colorful gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NK9SCpV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEHIYIJIA","source_asin":"B0B3XHR8TR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XHR8TR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XHR8TR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
