window.products.push({"id":735252,"name":"Wusthof Silverpoint II 7pc Garnishing Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Js5bwcRlL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description 7-Piece garnishing kit includes all you need to make beautiful garnishes. The set includes Channel knife, Zester, double edge peeler, butter curler, melon baller, corer in a handy storage roll. Amazon.com With the Wüsthof 7-Piece garnishing kit, you can create beautiful finishing touches without wasting time tracking down all your implements. Displaying the solid construction that Wüsthof is known for, the six garnishing tools in this set have stainless-steel working ends and molded slip-free handles. They include a channel knife, a zester, a double-edge peeler, a butter curler, a melon baller, and a corer. With a separate slot for each instrument, the storage case has a flexible roll construction, a secure snap closure, and a protective cover flap. This is a handy unit anywhere in the kitchen and also makes a useful addition to the gourmet bar. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Js5bwcRlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B00009WDSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009WDSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009WDSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":735253,"name":"Pot Rack Wall Mounted Cookware Rack Wall Storage Shelf Kitchen Hanging Organizer With 10 Hooks (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KMpNAD2CL._AC_SL1377_.jpg","description":"STURDY AND FIRM CONSTRUCTION: The wall pot rack made of thick, high-capacity iron, can withstand a weight of 30-40 lbs, thus you can definitely hang large copper or cast iron skillets. Moreover, this pot wall shelf has a durable, powder-coated finish, hand-made welding, specially treated and 100% rustproof. LARGE STORAGE CAPACITY: The wall organizer shelf dimension: 24.25\" L X 10\" W X 19\" H. You can put a lot stuffs on the large storage shelf with pots pans hanging on the 10 S shape hooks. Package includes grid rack with 2 support brackets, 10 hanging hooks, and mounting hardware. ASY TO ASSEMBLE: Minimal assembly required with quick set-up — Support brackets can be installed to support the rack from above or below — Beautiful decorative curved frame for stylish look — Complements most light fixtures, appliances, cookware, and design interiors. EFFICIENT SPACE SAVER: Eliminates clutter, frees cabinet space, and protect against scratches — Saves time and hassle of searching through cabinets and countertops — Built-in shelf provides added cupboard space and plenty of room to store essentials — Space-saving curved shape frame provides easy access for tight spaces and convenience for limited storage — Great for condominiums, tiny apartments, studios, small kitchens, or anywhere with limited storage space. MULTI-PURPOSE SHELF ORGANIZER: This wall storage rack is ideal for any room in the house — Install in kitchen, pantry, dining area for everyday cookware or bathroom to store drying towels and toiletries — Also suitable for study, office, or walk-in closet — Sturdy center grid does double duty and functions as shelf for books, baskets, toiletries, plants, and many other household items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KMpNAD2CL._AC_SL1377_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seenew","source_asin":"B07WC9WPKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WC9WPKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WC9WPKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
