window.products.push({"id":735295,"name":"Mokaro 48 Count Birthday Candles Bulk for Christmas Party Cakes Champagne Gold 5.6inch Long Thin Celebration Candles Luxurious Birthday Wedding Cupcak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DoZODmi4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specification: 🐣 Material: Paraffin 🐣 Color: Champagne Gold 🐣 Weight of 24 Count Set: 59.5g 🐣 Weight of 48 Count Set: 118.5g 🐣 Size: 13.5×0.6cm = 5.3×0.2inch (Length×Diameter) Birthday Candles Origin: 🎂 The custom of inserting candles on birthday cakes dates back to the ancient Greek and Roman era. 🎂 The admirers of the ancient Greek moon goddess Artemis, while celebrating the birthday of the moon goddess, placed a honey cake with burning candles on the altar. 🎂 Later, this custom gradually evolved into a burning candle on the child's birthday cake and added content to blow out the candle. 🎂 The ancient Greeks believed that burning candles had a mysterious and magical power. 🎂 If the child makes a wish and blows out all the candles in one breath, his dream will come true. 🎂 Therefore, this custom has been passed down to the present day. Birthday Candles' Use Tips: ⭐ Put the candle in the refrigerator and freeze it for a few minutes,then light the candle will not dropping the candle oil. Prohibited Matter: ❗ Candles should not be placed next to flammable items such as electrical appliances and curtains. Package List: 🎁 48×Birthday Candles 🎁 1×Thanks Card 100% Satisfication Guarantee: 💖 If there are any questions, please contact us in time by email. We will help you solve the problems within 24hrs. 💖 If the product you received were broken, we can refund to you or resend you a new one until you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DoZODmi4L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOKARO","source_asin":"B08CXGBQ79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CXGBQ79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CXGBQ79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
