window.products.push({"id":735335,"name":"Alarm Clock for Bedroom,Not-Ticking Silent Table Alarm Clock with Matt Metal Fram,4 inch Twin Bell Small Clock Battery Operated for Kids (Rose Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ct+RgFXkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Matt Metal Frame: Metallic iron look, well made, large black Arabic numbers, an awesome clear and simple style, looks conspicuous in your nightstand. Loud: The twin bell design and a mini-hammer offer an extra loud ringing, perfect for heavy sleepers, hearing impaired even deaf. Without snooze function, good wake-up alarm for trouble waking up. Non-Ticking: Retro style with sweep second hand, the clock works silently. Iit’s nice for a good working and learning environment, also for a soothing sleep. Battery Operated: Requires 1 x AA Carbon Zinc battery(not included) Easy to Read: Large numerals analog clock dial, easy to use, easy to read, perfect for kids or seniors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ct+RgFXkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxspace","source_asin":"B0868BF4TS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0868BF4TS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0868BF4TS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":735336,"name":"Wei Xi Universal in-Line Spark Plug Tester for Engine Ignition,6-12 Volt Fool-Proof Pick Up Coil/Armature Diagnostic Detector Tool for Motorcycles,Aut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZZQfCeICL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Inline Spark Plug Tester, Straight Boot Ignition Test Light for Most Engine Car, Motorcycle, Lawn Mower, Chainsaw! Features: 1. FUNCTION: The Engine Spark Tester is a must have diagnostic tool for any engine with a spark plug, & can quickly and easily diagnose ignition/engine outboard motor issues or a fault in the fuel delivery system. 2. HOW TO USE: Simply connect the tester between the spark plug and the plug wire, if spark is being sent, the tester will mirror the spark and light up - Find dirty spark plugs, defective points, bad cables or connections, etc.  3. DIMENSIONS: 6\" boot/cable, 5\" shaft/light housing; 2.2 oz. DESIGN: Nickel Plated Shaft, Double ended flexible tool offers a straight boot - Internal bulb lasts for years, but is replaceable through transparent housing.  4. WIDE APPLICATION: Essential Troubleshooting for All Internal & External Combustion Engines, cars, trucks, motorcycles, lawnmowers, chainsaws, trimmers, snow-blowers, generators etc. - A must have for any individual, professional mechanic garage and auto shop.  5. TIP: If you're testing in bright lighting conditions and not getting the right result, try again in a less bright environment. Another thing to try is to use the tester on another engine that you know to be good (under similar lighting conditions), and compare that flash to the one on your vehicle. Specification: Component: Plastic. Quantity: 1 Pack Engine Ignition Tester.  Color: Black. NOTICE: If you receive a product with damage or has other problems, please feel free to contact us, we will offer best customer service to you! Order with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZZQfCeICL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wei Xi","source_asin":"B0793MMHYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0793MMHYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0793MMHYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
