window.products.push({"id":735462,"name":"Handheld Vacuum Cordless Handheld Vacuum Cleaner for Car Portable Vacuum for Home, Powerful Suction Rechargeable 2200mAh and 1.8L Large Capacity Porta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZBiL9qcJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cordless and Convenient Retractable Handle: Easy to store and easy to control, the rechargeable handheld vacuum for car and home can be moved anywhere, anytime, and can be used without cords. The powerful motor helps you quickly clean in all directions. The portable vacuum cleaner cleans the dust, debris, and pet hair in cars and offices with excellent performance. Powerful Suction: With 120W power, it can produce up to 5500 Pa of vacuum suction. No matter where the tool falls, it will absorb wet or dry dirt and small garbage, and even a small amount of liquid can be absorbed without any problem. The SECULIA car handheld vacuum cleaner is exclusive to your car guard. Decent Battery Life and Fast Charging: Equipped with 2200mAh rechargeable lithium-ion battery as well as overcharge and short circuit protection to ensure safe charging and use. It can be used for up to 20 minutes and can be charged within 4 hours. Enough to meet the daily use of cleaning cars. Large Capacity Dust Cup: The vacuum cleaner weighs only 1.2 pounds and is equipped with a washable HEPA filter that can collect up to 1.8L of garbage. The filter in the vacuum cleaner can be easily taken out and cleaned to meet your daily convenience needs. Multifunctional Special Car Vacuum Cleaner Accessories: The vacuum cleaner comes with 4 different accessories, a crevice tool for removing spilled milk, coffee, tea, and other liquids; an extended hose which can easily reach the corners and spaces that are difficult to access, such as vehicle seat or large furniture; a brush tool for cleaning carpets, sofas and keyboards; a small brush for cleaning HEPA filters. Note: To achieve the best cleaning effect, please use it with accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZBiL9qcJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seculia","source_asin":"B0995KHQ1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995KHQ1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995KHQ1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
