window.products.push({"id":735522,"name":"Chic Home Ritz 20 Piece Comforter Set Color Block Bed in a Bag with Sheets Curtains, Queen, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XBGcCfWjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your entire bedroom with this masterful complete master bedroom ensemble. Color block piecing design appeals to a contemporary yet elegant sense of style. Super soft microfiber fabric is very soft and luxurious. This is a perfect set, in blue, it includes all the tools needed to design and decorate a master suite. Decor pillows, a complete sheet set and 2 sets of window treatments allow you to add all the touches needed to enhance your bedroom decor. Specifications: Size: Queen Color: Silver Piece Count: 20 Set Includes: 1pc Comforter (90” x 90”) 4pc Sheet Set (1 Fitted Sheet, 1 Flat Sheet, 2 Pillowcases) 2pc Shams (20” x 26” + 2”) 1pc Decorative Pillow (18” x 18”) 2pc Decorative Pillows (12” x 18”) 4pc Window Panels (40” x 84”) 2pc Valances (18” x 60”) 4pc Curtain Ties (3” x 18”) Shipping Dimensions (approx.): L 20\" x W 20\" x H 13\" Materials: Brushed microfiber fabric, Synthetic down alternative filling Fabric and Design: Silky soft brushed microfiber material Fashion forward pieced color block hotel collection design Features: Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning down alternative filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low * Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XBGcCfWjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B07MZS2N67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MZS2N67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MZS2N67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
