window.products.push({"id":735700,"name":"Levtex Home - Grandiflora Quilt Set - King Quilt + Two King Pillow Shams - Multicolor Bold Contemporary Floral - Quilt Size (106x92in.) and Pillow Sha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gERhZYcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton LEVTEX GRANDIFLORA QUILT BED SET: A floral, bright, bold sophisticated and fun bedding set consisting of a King size quilt (106x92in.) and two matching pillow shams (36x20in.).Ê Used by itself, as a layering piece or as a bedspread, this bedding set is extremely versatile. THE GRANDIFLORA DESIGN: One of our most popular quilt sets, Grandiflora is inspired by a watercolor floral portrait, with a print featuring big bold flowers, as if you were in a lush overgrown garden. A bound border provides contrast and texture to complete the look. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from 100% cotton that will never feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable, the Grandiflora quilt and pillow sham set has an ultra soft feel that youÕll simply love. Our quilt is very generously sized (106x92in.) to give your bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. EASY CARE: Pre washed for your convenience, the Grandiflora quilt and pillow sham set is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR ROOM DECOR: Create a wonderful bedroom space with our coordinated reversible matching bed set. The fuchsia, orange, peach, yellow, gold, blue and white design brings colorful, bright, fun boho accents into your home and will match a variety of different looks and bedroom decor. You can also freshen your room with matching items from the Levtex Home collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gERhZYcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B087YY8Y17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087YY8Y17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087YY8Y17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":735701,"name":"WEENFON 38\" Lift Top Coffee Table with Hidden Compartment & Open Storage Shelf, Pop Up Coffee Table for Living Room, Office, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717WR1oRAVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONVENIENT BECOMES DOUBLE: Do you eat or use your laptop on the coffee table? Hunch over no more. It’s great if you want to eat a meal on the couch or if you are working from home and want your laptop raised up to a better height. With the spacious surface, enjoy the option to effortlessly and smoothly raise the table independently for placing food, beverages, books and more so they are within arm’s reach while you are comfortably seated on your sofa AMAZING LIFT-TOP ERGONOMIC DESIGN: This lift top coffee table lifts up and comes to you when you need it to, and retracts into a standard-looking coffee table when that's all you need. The surface is surprisingly sturdy to use when it's lifted out. And when lifting or retracting, the surface stays completely flat, so no need to unload it when raising or lowering HELP WITH CLUTTER IN THE ROOM: James Bond type hideaway. Nice space saver allows you to access things that might always be used and are handy quickly. The storage underneath the top is great for storing games, laptop and remote controllers, keeping them dirt-free. Underneath storage is great for wireless speakers for the home entertainment enthusiast WITH CONTEMPORARY FLAIR: Are you looking for something that would match your living room? Our coffee table is the perfect purchase to finish off your collocation. Its compact structure and beautiful texture can surprisingly highlight your home decor. It changes the space dramatically YOUR SMILE IS WHAT WE ALWAYS PURSUE: Not satisfied? It's OK. Your professional customer service always has an open ear for any questions about our lift top coffee table. It's not hard to assemble except for the last step fastening the table top to the table body. For two people, it's a breeze. What are you waiting for? Action now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717WR1oRAVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEENFON","source_asin":"B0C4H8Q13T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4H8Q13T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4H8Q13T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
