window.products.push({"id":735808,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice Stainless Steel Toaster Two Slice Toaster with Removable Crumb Tray Toaster Wide Slot Toasters 2 Slice Best Rated Prime with 7 Bread S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ocNyKznL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Are You Frequently Rushing out House for Working in the Morning and Forgetting about Making Your Breakfast? The 2 slice Toaster Fast Heating, Time Saving When the energy-efficient toaster heating two slices of bread to a lovely golden brown. Now, It’s High Time That You Prepared a Delicious Breakfast by Adding a Toaster for Your Family! Specific Functions: 1,Bagel Technology:Press the BAGEL button.The bagel indicator will light up.Ensure bagel does not burn.Toast only one side, while warming the outside, of a cut bagel, English muffin or bun with the bagel setting. 2,Defrost: This toaster can defrost frozen bread before toasting if needed.3,Cancel: press the CANCEL button to stop toasting if you want. This button can be pressed at any time if necessary. How to Use Our Toaster? 1.insert the plug into a suitable mains supply socket and turn the power on 2.Place two slices bread,muffins or bagels into the bread slots.3.Select the desired browning setting,from No.7 on the browning control knob(No.1-lightest, No.7-darkest). Different types of bread and personal preference may require a different browning setting.4.Press the carriage control lever down until it clicks into place. Toasting cycle will automatically commence. Slice BagelToaster Specification: The Toaster Rated Power: 750W The Toaster 2 Slice Rated Voltage: 120V The Stainless Steel Toaster Slot Size:6.3\"x1.4\"(LxW)  The Bagel Toaster Size:11\"x6.6\"x7\"(LxWxH) Note For first use, because of the machine oil, it is normal thatthere may be some chemical smell which will dissipate in the future use. Wesuggest toasting without bread for a few minutes during the first use of thebread toaster. To prevent electric shock ,disconnect from the mains before removing cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ocNyKznL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iFedio","source_asin":"B0BZ3CDK4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ3CDK4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ3CDK4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
