window.products.push({"id":735855,"name":"Polder KTH-200 Compact Dish Rack with Glass Washer, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4133x4Xz9XL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Kitchen clean-up is a breeze with this innovative , all inclusive dish rack system. The stainless steel rack can rest on its drain tray or mount over the sink with its 24.5\" expandable arms. The drain tray has raised ribs, so you can dry large objsects like pots and pans, doubling your space. The double-brush glass washing station allows you to get to the bottom of those deep glasses. You can safely wash your fine glass items with soft bristles made just for the task. Amazon.com With this handsome wash-and-dry set, Polder manages to blend smart function and good looks--a surprisingly rare combination in a dish rack. Three pieces total, the set includes an expandable dish rack, a dual-purpose drain tray, and a glass scrubber. Designed for use on the tray or in the sink, the rack is made of corrosion-resistant stainless steel with expandable arms that reach 24-1/2 inches at full width. The drain tray stands beneath the rack to catch drips or serves as a separate drying surface for pots and large bowls, thanks to its integrated ribs. Shaped to stand flat or be held, the glass scrubber features two bristle wands to scrub the inside and outside of a glass. Its shape targets even the bottom of glasses, and it's gentle enough for wine stems and other delicate pieces. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4133x4Xz9XL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polder","source_asin":"B000I9LE1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000I9LE1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000I9LE1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
