window.products.push({"id":735904,"name":"Fiesta Plum 422 Medium Mixing Bowl 8.5\", 60oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C0RE8DY4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Fiesta Medium Mixing Bowl 8.5\", 60oz manufactured by The Homer Laughlin China company is the largest American Made manufatcturer of dinnerware, and the sole manufacturer of all Fiesta dinnerware. All Fiesta pieces are Microwave safe, Oven-proof, Dishwasher safe, Freezerproof, Lead-Free, and Made in America with the implementation of many green practices. The very durable glaze is great for everyday use. Fiesta as a pattern has stood the test of time, and is typically passed down from one generation to the next. We have kept the pattern constant through the years so that you can count on us to be here when you decide to expanding and change your collection. New pieces and colors are added every so often to keep things interesting. Currently, Fiesta is the most collected dinnerware in America. Amazon.com One of the most collected china patterns in the world, Fiestaware provides art deco styling that is enhanced by the strength of chip-resistant vitrified china and a nonporous, 100-percent lead-free glaze. Available in a variety of colors for fun mixing and matching, this medium 48-ounce mixing bowl is a perfect complement to any Fiestaware collection. Ideal for the function of mixing, as well as for serving salads, sides, or desserts, the multi-purpose bowl features signature Fiesta concentric rings and an elegant look that complements a wide range of decors. Made in the USA by the Homer Laughlin China Company, the bowl measures 8-1/2 by 3-1/2 inches and is safe to use in the oven, microwave, and dishwasher. --Catie Unger","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C0RE8DY4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homer Laughlin","source_asin":"B00196YR3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00196YR3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00196YR3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
