window.products.push({"id":735978,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld Get Froth in 7 Seconds High Powered with Support Stand and Coffee Stencils Electric Milk Coffee drink Mixer Perfect for Coffee C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gVb7TfE2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[More user-friendly design] Most of other milk frothers adopt vertical buttons. After investigation, we found that side button is more comfortable and easier to use, so we integrated it into our hand-held electric milk frother. Through practical tests, it's proved that this milk frother can also provides 4 times longer battery life using 2 AA batteries (not included). After new batteries are installed, it can be used for over 6 hours in total, while others can only be used for around 1.5 hours. [A new generation with stronger power] Our electric milk coffee blender uses a new generation of technology, it has stronger power and provides a speed of 17000rpm, creating thicker foams in a few seconds. Our handheld milk frother can be used in more mixtures, suitable for all types of milk, as well as creams, [Matcha, coffee, hot chocolate and more] Our matcha blender is more effective than a manual matcha beater. It can easily mix matcha powder to create a delicate taste. Our electric coffee blender can be used to make different types of coffee, such as lattes, cappuccinos, mochas and even bulletproof coffees. It can make thick and silky milk foam to meet all your expectations. [Made of high-quality materials] Our electric milk frother is made of only high-quality materials. The handle we use is non-slip ABS material and the blender portion is made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, which is safe and environmentally friendly. The bracket is also made of stainless steel, which is very stable and sturdy. The electric blender is very easy to clean, you can immerse into water and it will be completely clean in just a few seconds. [Exquisite set] Our handheld frother comes with a bracket and 16 stencils. The bracket makes it easy to store and does not take up space in your kitchen. We include 16 stencils of floral patterns made of reusable and safe ingredients so you can leave all kinds of lovely patterns on your coffee and enjoy a delicious cup of coffee. We offer a lifetime warranty; if you have any questions, please contact us and we will quickly solve it for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gVb7TfE2S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACT FIRE","source_asin":"B08R18JLWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-735978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R18JLWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R18JLWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
